# The bow in fog: where the act ends. Only reachable once Vane has said yes.
room bow_fog "The Marrow — The Bow"
  bg bg_bow_wide
  width 2560
  music music_fog
  ambience sea
  # Calibrated against the deck rail (~1 m) and the coils of rope.
  perspective horizon 555 ref 875 height 430
  # The deck between the rope coils, running back to the waist; the rail and the bowsprit
  # on the right are not floor.
  walk (250,875) (600,690) (660,665) (930,665) (1010,700) (1035,860) (1060,875)
  entry 700,800

  # Dorrit, halfway aft, to pass the word to the wheel.
  sprite npc_dorrit_body at 690,678 size 0.92 idle speaker dorrit for dorrit grade "saturate(0.6) brightness(0.9) contrast(0.85)"

  # The rocks and the open fog between the mast and the figurehead.
  hotspot fog "the fog"
    area 940,100 710x440
    stand 980,820
    look "Fog, thick as wet wool, with rocks in it. The reef is out there somewhere, smiling with all its teeth."
    use "I could shout bearings at it, but I'd need to know which way to shout."
    talk "“Hello?” The fog keeps the answer."

  hotspot figurehead "figurehead"
    area 1660,40 230x620
    stand 980,820
    look "The Marrow's figurehead, a carved woman with her chin up, staring the fog down. She has the look of someone who's heard it all before. She probably has."
    talk "I wish her luck. She seems to think I'm the one who needs it."

  hotspot lantern "bow lantern"
    area 1590,0 120x70
    nowalk
    look "The bow lantern, lit in broad day. In this fog it's less a light than a rumour of one."

  hotspot ropes "coiled rope"
    area 1040,690 300x180
    nowalk
    look "Rope, coiled sunwise, the way Hobb likes it. I've been told twice not to step in it, and once not to look at it like that."
    pickup "If I uncoil Hobb's rope, Hobb will coil me."

  hotspot dorrit "Dorrit"
    area 630,480 130x200
    stand 800,720
    look "Dorrit, posted halfway between the bow and the wheel, to pass the word. He's polished his spectacles for it."
    talk "“I relay bearings, clerk. Exactly as received. I take no responsibility for content.”"

  hotspot aft "way aft"
    area 300,520 380x140
    stand 640,700
    exit marrow_deck
    look "The deck, running back into the fog toward the waist, the wheel, and Quill."

  use compass on fog
    "I hold the compass out over the bow. The needle stops pretending to be a compass and points straight through the fog. I take a breath, and so, behind me, does everybody else."
    talk bearings
  use spyglass on fog
    "Fog, magnified. Very detailed fog."
